2	// Plan Map document link resolver
3	// ============================================================================
4	// This module chooses where Plan Map document links should go. The local Vite
5	// server can safely read a checkout through /@fs, while a static copy has no
6	// access to that disk path and must use the canonical GitHub copy instead.
7	// index.html uses this for both ordinary links and the document side drawer;
8	// the focused test file keeps the two destinations from drifting apart.
