                             "status":  "done",
                             "open":  0
                         },
                         {
                             "title":  "Tree batching: 379 instanced meshes -\u003e 16, scene draw calls 571 -\u003e 208, render 3.3ms -\u003e 1.2ms (2026-07-27)",
                             "status":  "done"
                         },
                         {
                             "title":  "ez-tree adopted for the streamed world; species 3 -\u003e 6 (2026-08-04)",
                             "status":  "done",
                             "status_note":  "World and combat map had two tree generators; only the combat one was art directed. ezTreeMeshSource merges branches+leaves to one unit-frame geometry so instancing/batching are untouched. Leaf mass 3.2x/1.6x after the first pass shipped wispier trees than the cones it replaced. flatShading off - closes the 2026-07-27 faceted complaint."
