                         {
                             "title":  "Understory layer (jungle-trail: ferns, logs, root runs, vines, litter, thickets)",
                             "status":  "specced",
                             "status_note":  "Remy call 2026-08-04. Aralia has NO understory - grass and bushes only, which is why the forest floor reads empty. Source: vendor/jungle-trail/src/world/plants.js (MIT)."
                         },
                         {
                             "title":  "Ground scars: spells change terrain durably, then heal",
                             "status":  "specced",
                             "decision":  true,
                             "status_note":  "Grilling 2026-08-05, 8 decisions in CONTEXT.md. Scars persist and decay via a per-window terrain sim mirroring townSim lastSimDay. A healed scar leaves a mark carrying its cause. Ground gets free-length layers plus buried objects. Cut faces show what was cut."
