                             "title":  "Facade audit: walls are paper, roads float, terrain has no underside",
                             "status":  "specced",
                             "decision":  true,
                             "status_note":  "docs/design/2026-08-05-facade-audit.md. Verified in source. wallGeometry emits 4 verts/segment, zero thickness, discards the widthM:1.2 it is given. Buildings/gatehouses/interiors/trees are honest. Grass/leaves/far-shells are correct cheats."
