                             "decision":  true,
                             "status_note":  "docs/adr/0001. Visual calls happen on a built surface, verdict stored beside the subject, plan map indexes them. Driven by 4 failures on 2026-08-05: verdicts lost to chat, throwaway rigs, 20m camera clamp hiding the subject, no staleness check."
                         },
                         {
                             "title":  "BUSH_PALETTE + bush scale: the real source of the green blobs",
                             "status":  "specced",
                             "status_note":  "Measured by the boulder agent: 3,780 sphereGeometry(1,6,4) instances, not rocks. groundChunkLoader BUSH_PALETTE ~line 3381 is the brightest green in the world; bScl line 3456 reaches 4.05m wide. Fix is ~10 lines, sits 3 lines from the understory palette."
                         },
                         {
                             "title":  "Volume ground + GPU fluid: 64m bubble at 25cm, WebGPU compute",
                             "status":  "active",
                             "decision":  true,
