                             "title":  "Volume sandbox size guard: 240m at 50cm/25cm froze the tab (110M/884M cells built synchronously in render) â€” every size button now states its grid, over-ceiling pairs refuse",
                             "status":  "done",
                             "open":  0
                         },
                         {
                             "title":  "Off-thread chunked volume build â€” removes the 256-cell edge ceiling the sandbox now enforces (fill + surface nets both run on the main thread today)",
                             "status":  "specced",
                             "open":  1
                         },
